2. HOW SETTLEMENT RUNS
   (UNCHANGED)

    1. Settlements pay into the
       multi-currency clearing
       account registered on
       your asset - the same
       account since COD,
       changeable only by
       dual-authorized written
       instruction (two
       signatories + a call-
       back to registered
       numbers), never by
       email confirmation.
    2. Previews, statements,
       and the TSO
       curtailment extract
       are in the MDM portal
       (type the address
       yourself).

  NordGrid will NEVER:
  - Announce a "clearing
    migration" for
    non-Nordic generators
    moving settlement to a
    new beneficiary such as
    "NordGrid Clearing ApS"
    (our settlement
    operations are
    in-house; no Danish
    clearing entity exists
    in our payment chain)
  - Ask you to "confirm"
    settlement accounts
    against an emailed IBAN
    before a cycle
  - Threaten that held
    settlements "re-price
    curtailment compensation
    by 9%" - curtailment
    compensation follows
    the TSO methodology and
    the grid connection
    agreement; it does not
    re-price based on
    payment timing
  - Use lookalike domains
    such as
    "nordgrid-settlement"
    or "ng-clearing"

